# An X session on Dolly's display: the Xsdl server, twm managing the
# windows, and three of X's own clients in theirs: a clock, eyes that follow
# the pointer and a terminal with a shell, where imgui-x11 starts Dear ImGui's
# example in a window of its own.
FROM /v0.1.4/Dollyfile-system ace3fd69f462238de61423ca89a4c282d22d9cd4d1ca6ba17e86e2bb490b147e
INSTALL /v0.1.4/demos/x11/Dollyfile-xorg-server 8e5a727372d42c957f61cee0b2e3d0ed53f4c88ffe8bf32d308cc74071c2e443
INSTALL /v0.1.4/demos/x11/Dollyfile-twm c5299b24de6d274285643e938b13803f0e09dc2d777d6e8b5a8ebedd0e4ae04d
INSTALL /v0.1.4/demos/x11/Dollyfile-xclock a34214108a35df6506b810e501ea17784519b5334b2570abe8bb190ef3e4b9f7
INSTALL /v0.1.4/demos/x11/Dollyfile-xeyes ba8988b021a1fe882731a0a78510a85ba3b32fa6ab9659379b876e5256580eef
